{"id":"n71699-1-15","stage":2,"title":"장사 · 生意","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71699-1-15-1","ko":"와, 가게에 손님이 많네!","zh":"哇，店里客人真多啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦。","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"가게에","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게에","audio":"/audio/dcd7d2a0ec316502a2f3.mp3"}},{"text":"손님이","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님이","audio":"/audio/8d63bf2c15d65035a7d2.mp3"}},{"text":"많네!","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많네","audio":"/audio/ef735989a6c05600e96b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9538535d100756f6e297.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71699-1-15-2","ko":"응, 요즘처럼만 장사가 잘 되면 금방 부자 되겠어.","zh":"嗯，要是能一直像现在这样生意好，很快就能发财啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘처럼만","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘처럼만","audio":"/audio/566d94eaa68a5a2296bc.mp3"}},{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사가","audio":"/audio/4931b0ea22819db2a3b1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"되면","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되면","audio":"/audio/dee0b5432173736e9b50.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"부자","meaning":"富翁，富豪，富人","explanation":"부자：富翁，富豪，富人。","readings":[{"term":"부자","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59725","senseId":"1","lemma":"부자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부자","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠어.","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠어","audio":"/audio/8a126b478c20ebd9cde6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"2d4b9735cbc26824","term":"부자","zh":"富翁，富豪，富人","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3","entryId":"59725",